{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2023-01-12 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT ENABLES AETHERTEK TO VALIDATE PERFORMANCE OF 5G MILLIMETER WAVE OPEN RAN RADIO UNITS', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS), A LEADING TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT DELIVERS ADVANCED DESIGN AND VALIDATION SOLUTIONS TO HELP ACCELERATE INNOVATION TO CONNECT AND SECURE THE WORLD, ANNOUNCED THAT AETHERTEK SELECTED THE KEYSIGHT OPEN RAN STUDIO SOLUTION TO VALIDATE THE END-TO-END PERFORMANCE OF ITS 5G MILLIMETER WAVE (MMWAVE) O-RAN RADIO UNITS (O-RU).'}